/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 62 0 R
/T (The Stock Price Analyzer is designed to simplify this process using Java programming and Data Structures and Algorithms. It allows users to enter stock records, search for companies, sort stock prices, calculate statistics and visualize price trends through charts. The application uses Java Swing to provide an interactive graphical interface and file handling to save data permanently.)
/E (The Stock Price Analyzer is designed to simplify this process using Java programming and Data Structures and Algorithms. It allows users to enter stock records, search for companies, sort stock prices, calculate statistics and visualize price trends through charts. The application uses Java Swing to provide an interactive graphical interface and file handling to save data permanently.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [14]
>>
